# Malaysian SST — Industry Reference Compendium
**Prepared by:** YYC taxPOD — Senior SST Consultant desk
**As of:** 28 October 2026
**Scope:** Sales Tax Act 2018 (ACJ 2018) + Service Tax Act 2018 (ACP 2018), their regulations, RMCD Panduan Industri, Sales Tax Policies (STP), Service Tax Policies, Dasar Cukai Perkhidmatan (DCP), and Public Rulings 2025–2026.

> Navigation + quick-reference. Each row cites the authoritative PDF in the local library. Always confirm against the latest-dated guide before advising a client.

