## 0. Framework at a glance

### 0.1 Two parallel regimes
| Pillar | Legislation | Scope | Rates |
|---|---|---|---|
| Sales Tax | Sales Tax Act 2018 + Sales Tax Regulations 2018 + Sales Tax (Rates of Tax) Orders | Single-stage tax on taxable goods manufactured in Malaysia or imported | 5%, 10% default; petroleum specific; 0% for Schedule A exempt |
| Service Tax | Service Tax Act 2018 + Service Tax Regulations 2018 (First Schedule Groups A–L) | Prescribed taxable services provided by a taxable person in Malaysia + imported taxable services + digital services | 6% (default), 8% (expanded 1-3-2024 for most services except F&B, telco, parking, logistics), credit card RM25/card/year |

### 0.2 Expanded Service Tax (effective 1-7-2025)
Extended service tax to rental/leasing of goods, construction works, private healthcare for non-citizens, education for non-citizens/high-fee, financial fee-based services; tightened B2B/intra-group rules. Transitional reliefs via STPs 2–6 of 2025, further amended into 2026.

### 0.3 Registration thresholds (12-month historical or prospective)
| Category | Threshold |
|---|---|
| Sales Tax — Manufacturer | RM 500,000 |
| Service Tax — F&B (Group B) | RM 1,500,000 |
| Service Tax — Rental/Leasing (Group K) | RM 1,000,000 (STP 4-2026) |
| Service Tax — Construction (Group L) | RM 1,500,000 |
| Service Tax — Private Healthcare | RM 1,500,000 (non-citizen revenue) |
| Service Tax — Education (private higher ed, intl schools) | RM 1,500,000 |
| Service Tax — All other taxable services | RM 500,000 |
| Digital Services (FSP) | RM 500,000 |

### 0.4 Cross-cutting mechanisms
- **B2B exemption** — same taxable service re-supplied by one registered person to another registered person in the same prescribed group.
- **Intra-group relief** — >=50% common holding; services provided to third parties <=5% of total value in 12 months (the "5% rule"). See CDE Panduan.
- **CDE group election** — see Service Tax/CDE/Panduan Kumpulan CDE_4.9.25.pdf (latest).
- **Disbursement vs reimbursement** — disbursement (pure agent, principal-third party contract, no mark-up) not subject; reimbursement subject at applicable rate.
- **Imported taxable service (ITS)** — Malaysian recipient self-accounts in SST-02; applies to all businesses (carrying-on-business test).
- **Exchange rate** — PR 1-2026 and PR 3-2026.

