## 6. QUICK-DECISION CHECKLIST FOR A NEW ENGAGEMENT

1. Identify Group: F and B B, Hotel A, Logistics J, Hire Vehicle J, Rental K, Construction L, Grp G (professional, mgmt, IT, employment, brokerage), Grp H (financial, insurance, credit card), Grp I (healthcare, parking, MV, advertising).
2. Threshold test: 500k or 1m or 1.5m; 12-month rolling.
3. Rate: 6 percent or 8 percent per Rate Order.
4. Reliefs: B2B exemption, intra-group (5 percent rule or CDE), non-reviewable contract, residential carve-out, export of service.
5. Trigger date: invoice OR payment, whichever earlier; payment-basis election.
6. Imported Taxable Service: foreign vendor billing the client? Self-account.
7. Record-keeping: 7 years, bilingual, in Malaysia.
8. Return: bi-monthly SST-02; late payment penalty 10 or 15 or 15 percent (6-month tiers), max 40 percent.

